# ── OPTIONAL: keep the curated dataset OUT of git ──────────────────────────
# The dataset is fully anonymized (generic Magento patterns only), so it is
# safe to commit and is tracked by default. If you'd rather keep it private,
# uncomment the lines below. Note: data/_data.py holds the same content inline.
# data/all.jsonl
# data/train.jsonl
# data/valid.jsonl
# data/REPORT.md

# Fused models (multi-GB, do not commit)
qwen-magento*/
build-gguf/

